+// Relocate the guest's top-down arena, in place, on a register that already
+// holds the OR'd address. Deliberately flag-free and scratch-free: FEX keeps
+// guest arithmetic flags in the host NZCV register, so a compare-and-select
+// here would corrupt them, and every spare temporary is already spoken for.
+// Exact because the cleared field is set in every arena address and clear in
+// every other hostable one, which makes this the identity outside the arena.
+void Arm64JITCore::ApplyGuestTopRelocation(ARMEmitter::Register Reg) {
+  const uint64_t ClearMask = CTX->GetGuestTopClearMask();
